  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Soil 300 CERTIFICATION REQUIREMENTS\n\nREVISION NOTE #1:\n\nDocument #9886-A and Document #9886-B, effective 3-11-11, readopted with amendments Chapters Soil 300 and Soil 400. Document #9886-A also readopted with amendments Chapter Soil 500. Document #9886-A also renumbered rules within Chapter Soil 300, as follows:\n\nFormer Rule New Rule",
